  "description": "Once a revered war hero, Ezekiel is reduced to a tortured man when he is blinded by poison. Ezekiel seeks to regain his eyesight and get his revenge against the woman who poisoned him, but he is utterly blind to the fact that she is the new maid in his manor, Rose. Having been previously blackmailed into harming Ezekiel, Rose is resolved to spend the rest of her life serving him. However, complications arise as the two of them grow closer. Can there be a happy ending for a relationship that was poisoned from the beginning?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
